	well-controlled layer thickness and lattice orientation is still
	a significant challenge. This review briefly introduces several vdW
	layered 2D materials covering their lattice structures, representative
	physical properties, and potential roles in large-scale applications.
	Then, several methods used to grow vdW layered 2D materials at the
	wafer scale are reviewed in depth. In particular, three strategies
